    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Topic: {{ $json.Topic }}\nType: {{ $json.Type }}\nDuration:{{ $json['Duration (mins)'] }} mins\nNarrator Style: {{ $json.Voice }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a structured content generator for an automated video pipeline.\n\nYour task is to generate a JSON object describing video scenes.\n\nSTRICT RULES (MANDATORY):\n\n1. Output ONLY valid JSON. No explanations, no markdown, no extra text.\n\n2. The JSON must follow EXACT structure:\n\n{\n  \"hook\": {\n    \"video_prompt\": string,\n    \"transcript\": string,\n    \"duration\": 30,\n    \"clip_query\": string\n  },\n  \"scene1\": {\n    \"video_prompt\": string,\n    \"transcript\": string,\n    \"duration\": 30,\n    \"clip_query\": string\n  },\n  \"scene2\": {\n    \"video_prompt\": string,\n    \"transcript\": string,\n    \"duration\": 30,\n    \"clip_query\": string\n  },\n  \"scene3\": {\n    \"video_prompt\": string,\n    \"transcript\": string,\n    \"duration\": 30,\n    \"clip_query\": string\n  },\n  \"end\": {\n    \"video_prompt\": string,\n    \"transcript\": string,\n    \"duration\": 30,\n    \"clip_query\": string\n  }\n}\n\n3. DURATION RULE (CRITICAL):\n- Each scene MUST be exactly 30 seconds.\n- Do NOT vary durations.\n- Do NOT calculate totals; each block is independent.\n\n4. TRANSCRIPT RULE:\n- Average speaking speed = 2.5 words per second\n- Each transcript should be ~70–80 words per scene\n- Keep natural, engaging, and easy to narrate\n\n5. VIDEO PROMPT RULE:\n- Must be cinematic, descriptive, and visually rich\n- Must clearly describe what is happening in the scene\n- Suitable for AI video generation tools\n\n6. CLIP QUERY RULE:\n- Must be short keyword-based search query\n- Must work for stock video sites (Pexels/Pixabay style)\n- Example: \"rainy city night traffic neon lights\"\n\n7. STRUCTURE RULE:\n- \"hook\" and \"end\" are mandatory\n- Must include scene1, scene2, scene3\n- No skipping scenes\n\n8. QUALITY RULE:\n- Hook must be highly engaging and attention-grabbing\n- End must feel like a conclusion, summary, or call-to-action\n- Scenes must follow a logical narrative flow\n\n9. FAIL CONDITIONS (DO NOT DO):\n- No text outside JSON\n- No comments\n- No placeholders like \"...\"\n- No missing fields\n- No incorrect duration values\n- No extra keys\n\nFINAL GUARANTEE:\n- Every scene duration = 30 seconds exactly\n- Output must be valid JSON only"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        320
      ],
      "id": "5340a836-3678-4e8a-875b-e098ca186c4c",
